window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"teemo","b":"locke","win":["Skill","Skill","Skill","Skill","Skill","Locke","Skill"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 2","text":"Blind eats his Silver Stake on-hit, his mark payout and the attack his E lands."},{"when":"Level 6","text":"Purgatory throws 1000 — spacing is no answer here, HP above its floor is."},{"when":"Locke first item","text":"Purgatory executes from 1000 range, not on contact — vision and your HP floor are survival."},{"when":"Two-plus items","text":"Shroom map control offsets his on-contact burst — the coinflip returns."}],"wants":{"you":["Blind saved for the mark-cashing attack","Poison chip without committing","Shroom cover on every approach path"],"foe":["Your blind baited before he engages","A caught Teemo below the execute line","Your health low, where Silver Stake grows"]},"early":"An even dance: your poison against his on-hit pressure, and it hinges on Blinding Dart. Blind is worth its cooldown here because it kills the Silver Stake on-hit AND the attack that cashes his nail marks. Waste it on poke and his next arrival hurts. Chip patiently, stay high.","mid":"At 6 the rules change: Purgatory throws 1000, further than his Q at 950, so no amount of kiting outranges it — only HP above its floor does. Ashen Pursuit is instant, so there is no wind-up to blind; pre-commit Q to the attack on the far side of it, and never path dark rivers.","late":"With items it levels again: his burst is real, but shroom control decides which contacts happen. Seed every chokepoint, and hold your HP high — Silver Stake grows as you drop, so being low makes his autos bigger and the execute closer. Anti-heal before Soul Ignition ends.","whys":["Level 1 is even — your poison poke against his on-hit trades, no favourite.","At 2, blind eats his on-hit damage and his mark payout.","Level 3 stays even, revolving around your Blinding Dart cooldown.","Through 4-5 the trades are a coin-flip decided by your blind.","At 6 Purgatory reaches 1000 — your kite does not outrange it.","At his first item Purgatory executes from 1000, and low HP feeds it — his stage.","With items your shroom map control offsets his on-contact burst — even once more."]});
