window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"teemo","b":"zaahen","win":["Teemo","Teemo","Teemo","Teemo","Skill","Teemo","Teemo"],"spikes":[{"when":"Zaahen level 2","text":"Aureate Rush closes on a 10s cooldown while your dart is a flat 7s — hold the blind for his dash."},{"when":"Levels 4-5","text":"Shroom zoning and poke stabilise the lane — your safest farming window."},{"when":"Zaahen first item","text":"His durability and sustain shrug off your poke even through the blind."},{"when":"Zaahen two items","text":"He wins any isolated 1v1 — never be isolated again."}],"wants":{"you":["Range held, dart up before he E's","Shroom fields between you and him","Cross-map value while he sidelanes"],"foe":["Your blind down when he commits","An isolated Teemo with no escape","Sustain wars your poke cannot win"]},"early":"Level 1 is yours — ranged poke against a melee auto-reset — then the threat turns real: from 2 Aureate Rush closes every 10s, and by 3 his Q-E burst beats your poke once he reaches you. Your dart is a flat 7s, so it out-cycles his dash: hold it for the gap-close, not the chip.","mid":"Levels 4-5 are yours as shrooms and poke zone his approaches — bank that safety, because both item stages after are his: durability and passive sustain shrug off your chip even through the blind. Wait for Aureate Rush before you step up, shove from range, and convert the lane into map control.","late":"At two items he wins any isolated 1v1, so delete the word isolated from your game: move with teammates, shroom every river and flank, and poison-kite from behind your frontline. His kill pattern needs to catch one champion alone — your entire job is making sure that champion never exists.","whys":["Level 1 is yours: ranged poke against a melee auto-reset.","At 2 Aureate Rush closes every 10s; your dart is 7s, so save it for that.","Level 3 is his: the Q-E burst beats your poke once he reaches you.","Levels 4-5 are yours: shrooms and poke zone his approaches.","Level 6 is a wash in-lane — your R threatens his movement, not the duel itself.","At his first item his durability and passive sustain beat your poke through the blind.","With 2+ items he wins the isolated 1v1 against a no-escape squishy — stay unfindable."]});
