window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"teemo","b":"masteryi","win":["Teemo","Teemo","Teemo","Skill","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Blinding Dart switches off Double Strike and Wuju Style — all but his Alpha Strike."},{"when":"Level 3","text":"Blind also starves Alpha Strike: only his landed attacks cut its ~20s cooldown."},{"when":"Yi first item","text":"His DPS now beats one blind window, and Meditate heals it back — buy Grievous Wounds."},{"when":"Yi two items","text":"Highlander ignores every slow, so shrooms stop zoning him and only burn — group instead."}],"wants":{"you":["Early farm denial while the blind rules","A CS and HP lead cashed before his spike","Shroom fields set before his R lands"],"foe":["Quiet scaling into first item","Your blind baited before the real commit","Highlander up, ignoring slows"]},"early":"You bully the first three levels: Blinding Dart switches off Double Strike and Wuju Style's true damage, since both ride on basic attacks. Alpha Strike is the exception — ability damage, and untargetable while it runs, so never dart him mid-dash. Starve his farm; every denied wave delays his spike.","mid":"Levels 4-5 even out as his speed closes the gap, but every blind does double work: Alpha Strike is ~20s at rank 1 and only ticks down off his landed attacks. At 6 read Highlander properly — it makes him immune to slows, so shrooms still burn but no longer zone. Play for the map.","late":"From his first item his DPS beats one blind window, and Meditate heals through your chip while freezing his Wuju Style and Highlander timers — Grievous Wounds is a real buy. Never sidelane him: Highlander is 85s, ignores slows, extends on every takedown. Blind for your team.","whys":["Blinding Dart shuts off his attack damage entirely at level 1.","At 2 your blind and poison keep denying every trade he wants.","Level 3 your Q kiting and Toxic Shot still out-poke his kit.","Levels 4-5 even out, but each blind you land also keeps Alpha Strike's ~20s clock full.","At 6 Highlander ignores slows — shrooms burn him but no longer zone.","At first item his sustained DPS beats you through one blind window — the duel turns his.","At 2+ items he out-duels you, and each takedown extends Highlander and refunds his cooldowns."]});
